**Reasoning sketch.** The sign prefactor is $(-1)^{\dim M}=(-1)^{300}=+1$, so $\nu_X(P)=1-\chi(F_P)$. For torus-fixed (monomial) points of $\operatorname{Hilb}^n(\mathbb C^3)$, the Behrend function is $(-1)^n$, which is consistent with the generating function $M(-q)$ for plane partitions. Here $n=12$ is even, so the heuristic value is $+1$. $P$ is not torus-fixed (because of the term $y^3-xz$), so this does not establish the value at $P$. I did not compute $\chi(F_P)$ directly.

